{"id":1110,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>为进一步扩大学校影响力，拓宽优质生源渠道，按照学校招生工作统一部署，6月26日，中北大学人文社会科学学院李建明、石慧敏和罗宁辉三位教师赴应县一中开展招生宣传工作。</p><p>此次宣传活动受到应县一中校方的热烈欢迎，校长谭富德亲切接待了我院宣传组一行。双方围绕生源对接、校地合作等内容开展交流。随后，宣传团队与该校师生代表深入互动，系统介绍了中北大学办学特色、学科优势、师资力量、人才培养及升学就业等核心情况，细致解读相关招生政策，并现场耐心解答师生咨询，发放招生宣传资料，帮助大家全面了解学校办学情况与报考信息。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=lL7Wr2nl-aL4UbLIm9bnRCZMm-inRG5soRrfo7C4U4CDL8C0gihFp2hmCIa0U1ybn1yYM1yYnzrkM4UYnzGbM4nfM4NsnlL4M4vinmliU4WFM4QVLm7bM7VFLzG4L7UJqjfTQ4Oeo4xY6sAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLzCsMYbw62C8c&oid=1219086494&tid=1011&nid=11677&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/B9F262E5B742E0974A797EC3775F55C2/76E2194A/1030D\" vheight=\"224.3300018310547\" vwidth=\"299.07000732421875\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=lL7Wr2nl-aL4UbLIm9bnRCZMm-inRG5soRrfo7C4U4CDL8C0gihFp2hmCIa0U1ybn1yYM1yYnzrkM4UYnzGbM4nfM4NsnlL4M4vinmliU4WFM4QVLm7bM7VFLzG4L7UJqjfTQ4Oeo4xY6sAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLzCsMYbw62C8c&oid=1219086494&tid=1011&nid=11677&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;（6月26日，应县一中校长谭富德接待中北大学宣传组一行。）</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=lM4VrRL7nVLzU8MIRMRLNM2Mm-bnRT57oRLPUNlYLlM7Mm90gihFp2hmCIa0M1ybL1hRoSyZUN78MlQRozGYol-4LmVfnzARnlV2U4TVLR6FoznVL8UDL4MFUmf2L1b/v2rjo4OeosWs_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PMmvsgtA8pUCcc&oid=1219086494&tid=1011&nid=11677&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/692C98BA45FC9029B321AE8CEAFC9E07/94E3D633/B0F2\" vheight=\"189.1300048828125\" vwidth=\"252.1300048828125\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=lM4VrRL7nVLzU8MIRMRLNM2Mm-bnRT57oRLPUNlYLlM7Mm90gihFp2hmCIa0M1ybL1hRoSyZUN78MlQRozGYol-4LmVfnzARnlV2U4TVLR6FoznVL8UDL4MFUmf2L1b/v2rjo4OeosWs_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PMmvsgtA8pUCcc&oid=1219086494&tid=1011&nid=11677&e=.jpeg\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=lUzLr4LRQRM7WVLI4NZoRl8nRUDL8n52U4ffoRUsL498U4l0gihFp2hmCIa0UShRoSy8nSysM8UZLNlPnNWfMzNPMz7iozN4LRr2UzV2nRTFU8l4ozlaozMFoz78UYb/v2rjo